73
00:02:32,925 --> 00:02:34,678
If you like seeing
what hides behind the

74
00:02:34,725 --> 00:02:36,711
numbers, subscribe.

75
00:02:37,047 --> 00:02:39,102
Here we follow the
money all the way to

76
00:02:39,172 --> 00:02:39,869
the water.

77
00:02:40,571 --> 00:02:42,927
Our ship arrives off
