118
00:04:05,777 --> 00:04:07,681
And the cheapest toll
in history?

119
00:04:07,815 --> 00:04:10,079
In nineteen
twenty-eight, the adventurer

120
00:04:10,172 --> 00:04:12,273
Richard Halliburton
