121
00:04:12,563 --> 00:04:15,257
He was charged by
weight, like a ship.

122
00:04:15,512 --> 00:04:16,813
Thirty-six cents.

123
00:04:17,567 --> 00:04:19,646
Our ship enters the
Agua Clara locks on

124
00:04:19,681 --> 00:04:20,668
the Atlantic side.

125
00:04:20,923 --> 00:04:22,781
Steel gates up to
thirty-three meters

126
00:04:22,827 --> 00:04:24,104
tall close behind it.

127
00:04:24,325 --> 00:04:26,020
Water flows in
through openings in the

128
00:04:26,055 --> 00:04:26,647
