forests around it.

146
00:05:03,182 --> 00:05:05,190
No rain, no canal.

147
00:05:05,901 --> 00:05:08,165
Further on, the ship
enters the Culebra

148
00:05:08,235 --> 00:05:09,802
Cut, a channel carved
through the

149
00:05:09,849 --> 00:05:11,091
continental divide.

150
00:05:11,218 --> 00:05:13,412
Thousands of workers
dug through rock and

151
00:05:13,505 --> 00:05:15,247
constant landslides
to open it.

152
00:05:15,966 --> 00:05:17,918
And here is a strange
fact.

153
00:05:18,545 --> 00:05:21,134
The Pacific entrance
of the canal lies

154
00:05:21,192 --> 00:05:23,061
