158
00:05:31,572 --> 00:05:34,382
In twenty
twenty-three, the rain stopped.

159
00:05:35,102 --> 00:05:37,261
Panama had one of its
driest years on

160
00:05:37,331 --> 00:05:39,572
record, with about
forty percent less

161
00:05:39,641 --> 00:05:40,860
