171
00:06:00,684 --> 00:06:02,531
A few dry months in
Central America

172
00:06:02,613 --> 00:06:04,412
changed shipping
costs all over the

173
00:06:04,459 --> 00:06:04,946
world.

174
00:06:05,365 --> 00:06:07,362
Now Panama is
preparing a new reservoir

175
00:06:07,408 --> 00:06:09,440
on the Río Indio,
so that the next

176
00:06:09,475 --> 00:06:11,437
