177
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:14,857
After roughly eleven
hours in the canal,

178
00:06:15,251 --> 00:06:17,644
our ship reaches the
Cocolí locks on the

179
00:06:17,690 --> 00:06:18,735
Pacific side.

180
00:06:19,072 --> 00:06:22,137
Three more steps,
this time down, and the

181
00:06:22,207 --> 00:06:24,297
